{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源辦公套件LibreOffice背後的組織「文檔基金會」（The Document Foundation，簡稱TDF）近日再次將矛頭指向微軟，公開回顧並批評Office Open XML（OOXML）成為國際標準的過程，稱微軟當年通過影響標準化程序，推動OOXML獲得國際標準組織批准，而非支持開放文檔格式（ODF）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583584.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.460762+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:40:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_hash":"0635e542a5fa15dfa3c6298c111bd5a696c44401728faf2da2e2038fcece3223","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}